# Daily.co video (ADR-018)

- Only `packages/video` imports `@daily-co/*`. Routes in `apps/api` call `@eleva/video`.
- Rooms: private. Until D-07: deterministic names `eleva-{bookingId}` on a **standard**
  (not HIPAA) Daily domain, `nbf`/`exp` around the booking, recording off. After D-07:
  random names + fingerprint reconciler. `max_participants` from the booking.
- Meeting tokens are minted at join time per participant (expert `is_owner`). Never store,
  log or put tokens in URLs.
- Verify webhook signatures (`DAILY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`). Process events in event-time order
  (`sessions.last_event_at`). No PHI in logs or Sentry.
- Recording / transcription is **not** in Phase 9 or 10 — backlog 16.8, gated on D-07/D-08.
- Revoke is two-phase: `session_participants.revoked_at` then Daily `eject`.
- Google Meet / Zoom / Teams links are never created (removed, see ADR-018).
